.TH SWAPOFF 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
swapoff \- disables swap on a file or device; requires cap_sys_admin
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/swap.h>
.B int swapoff(const char* path);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Disables swap on a file or device; requires CAP_SYS_ADMIN.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR swapoff (2)
